Romania Economic Indicators — License

This dataset aggregates data from 8 official institutions whose own publication
terms are not uniform. No single standard license (CC0, CC-BY, ODbL, etc.) is
asserted for the dataset as a whole, because that would overstate what has
been explicitly granted by every source. Instead, the terms stated by each
source are reproduced below, as documented in eCifre's public data pipeline:
https://github.com/eCifre/romania-economic-data/blob/main/LICENSE_NOTES.md

Sources present in this dataset:

- INSSE (Institutul National de Statistica) — published as public data;
  INSSE does not state an explicit open-reuse license.
- BNR (Banca Nationala a Romaniei) — published as public data; no explicit
  reuse license stated.
- MFIN (Ministerul Finantelor) — published as public data; no explicit
  reuse license stated.
- ANOFM (Agentia Nationala pentru Ocuparea Fortei de Munca) — published as
  public data; no explicit reuse license stated.
- ANRE (Autoritatea Nationala de Reglementare in Domeniul Energiei) —
  published as public data; no explicit reuse license stated.
- ONRC (Oficiul National al Registrului Comertului) — published as public
  data; no explicit reuse license stated.
- Eurostat — (c) European Union, 1995 - today. Eurostat's standard reuse
  policy (Commission Decision 2011/833/EU) permits free reuse, including
  commercially, with attribution.
- ENTSO-E Transparency Platform — reuse permitted under EU Regulation
  543/2013, which mandates the platform's data be public.

None of the sources above are known to carry redistribution restrictions.
Two sources eCifre uses elsewhere (Bursa de Valori Bucuresti / BVB, and
OPCOM) do carry explicit written-consent-required restrictions and are
deliberately excluded from this dataset and from every public eCifre export.

If you plan to redistribute this data further, please check source_url for
the specific rows you are using, and confirm current terms directly with
the relevant institution.

Attribution is appreciated:
eCifre — Romania Economic Indicators
https://ecifre.ro
